Domain Entity Budget
    documentation 'This financial entity represents the amount of monies allocated to be spent or 
                  'received by an education organization as related to a specific account.
    currency Amount
        documentation 'Amount budgeted for the account for this fiscal year.
        is required
    date AsOfDate
        documentation 'The date of the reported budget element.
        is part of identity
    reference Account
        documentation 'Account with which the Budget is associated.
        is part of identity